# Documentation

- Write primary docs in English. Keep the Spanish quick start in `README.md`.
- Describe the command outcome and the software stop the way the code behaves.
- Mark unfinished integrations as planned in the same change that mentions them.
- Add an ADR when a persistence, process, or safety boundary changes.

Do not document a provider, a broker, or a device as working unless a test or a local run exercised it. Do not copy CleanYourTV source into the docs.
